We have sent patrols to find the Russian base in this sector. As soon as they find it, we will relay the information to you; then you will organize a strike force to destroy the base.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Build up a strike force.
- Launch a strike against the Russian base, once its location is known.

SITUATION REPORT:
This mission is one of a series of coordinated strikes to eliminate all Russian emplacements on Elysium. Once they are all complete, we will return to Ganymede and retake control of the portal.